<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn cattle market not well tested - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn cattle market not well tested - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers were not tested on a live basis, compared with Monday's close, USDA said. On a carcass basis, steers and heifers were not well tested, with a higher undertone noted.</p>
<p>Steers:  Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1200-1300 lb few 114.00-115.00. Heifers: Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1150 lb pt ld 114.00 Reported sales for Tues: 200. Week to Date: 6,800</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
</text>
